<!-- Themed-icon version: one color only. The front of the sticker is solid with the face cut out.
     The peeled corner is cut out of the front too and drawn as an outline with a faint fill, so it
     reads as the lighter back of the paper. Launchers that drop partial alpha show the background
     there instead, which reads the same way. -->
